    "bodySample": "‹‹ SALES ▾ FUNDING ▾ ⬡ Lenders ▩ Finance OS BETA ✒ Contracts ◍ Subscriptions BETA CLIENT OPS ▾ WATCH ▾ AUTOMATION ▾ MARKETING ▾ ADMIN ▾ PORTALS ▾ fundhub Beta — under development. Data may be incomplete or inaccurate. Do not use for client decisions. Dismiss SETUP Subscriptions ← Command Center · ← Client hub Subscriptions NO CLIENT The plan this client is on, the price, and the card on file for it. Nothing on this page charges anybody. Starting, changing or cancelling a plan here writes down what the client is on. There is no card processor connected to this system, so no money moves and no invoice is raised. A card below is a reference to a card held by a processor — a token, plus the brand, last four digits and expiry so a person can tell one card from another. The card number itself is not here, is not asked for, and is refused if it is sent. No client is open, so nothing is shown here — a plan and a card belong to a named person. Find the client by name, email or phone. Opening them keeps them open, and Subscriptions in the sidebar then comes straight back to this screen for that person. Find a client A link that already names the client works too — subscriptions.html?client_id=<id>. Payment links NO CLIENT A Commas checkout link for one amount — a deposit, the diagnostic fee, a repair charge, or anything else. Unlike the plan above, this DOES move money: the client pays Commas directly, and this screen only records the ask and, once Commas tells us, the result. No client is open, so there are no payment links to show — a link is always raised against one client. systems nominal · fundhub.ai no client named TEST — Owner Role · owner · 34 tabs LIVE Sign out Search ⌘K Chat"
